    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quebec Mortis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quebec Mortis is a retro adventure game including three unique stories. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each story uses a different film genre, gameplay and Quebecer environnement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 1 - Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Louis calls his brother but he doesn't answer. He leaves a message &quot;please don't do anything stupid!&quot;. Louis quickly heads out to his brother's home but he is missing... He decides to stay there for the night and go look for his brother the next day. This is when you come into play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 2 - Western</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serge finds himself involuntarily in the midst of a dispute at the heart of the Western festival. Someone put Serge up to this and was able to convince him. But how? All he wanted was to buy a simple hat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 3 - Sci-Fi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kas is woken up after hearing some strange noise. Is it her mother calling for help ? Kas walks through the spaceship that seems corrupted by some kind of evil entity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00c9pisode 4 - Fantaisie</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This year, David convinces Erika to join him at Bicolline, without realizing it will lead him to face his greatest fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4 mysterious stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quebec-inspired environments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different gameplay mechanics: Survival Horror, Puzzle, Metroidvania, RPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A humorous and psychological twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and routes available.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The episodes are designed to be completed in one playthrough. Concise and fun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold Z - Open menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X - Execute action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports your usual controller as well, connect it and it will be discovered.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quebec Mortis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quebec Mortis is a retro adventure game including three unique stories. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each story uses a different film genre, gameplay and Quebecer environnement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 1 - Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Louis calls his brother but he doesn't answer. He leaves a message &quot;please don't do anything stupid!&quot;. Louis quickly heads out to his brother's home but he is missing... He decides to stay there for the night and go look for his brother the next day. This is when you come into play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 2 - Western</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serge finds himself involuntarily in the midst of a dispute at the heart of the Western festival. Someone put Serge up to this and was able to convince him. But how? All he wanted was to buy a simple hat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 3 - Sci-Fi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kas is woken up after hearing some strange noise. Is it her mother calling for help ? Kas walks through the spaceship that seems corrupted by some kind of evil entity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00c9pisode 4 - Fantaisie</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This year, David convinces Erika to join him at Bicolline, without realizing it will lead him to face his greatest fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4 mysterious stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quebec-inspired environments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different gameplay mechanics: Survival Horror, Puzzle, Metroidvania, RPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A humorous and psychological twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and routes available.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The episodes are designed to be completed in one playthrough. Concise and fun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold Z - Open menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X - Execute action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports your usual controller as well, connect it and it will be discovered.</p>",
    "short_description": "Top down retro adventure game with 4 different stories. Survival horror, western, sci-fi and fantasy. Each episode is set in Quebec.",
